From: Prit Patel <prit.patel00@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 10:33:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 2: production config for Railway (API, speech,
 frontend)

- Add Dockerfiles for backend/api, backend/speech, and frontend
  (frontend now runs as a self-hosted Node server on Railway, not
  Vercel, since it runs on vinext which has no Vercel adapter)
- Set output: "standalone" in frontend/next.config.ts
- Replace hardcoded localhost URLs in keycloak.ts and inventory-api.ts
  with NEXT_PUBLIC_* env vars (localhost fallback preserved for dev)
- Add prisma migrate deploy / migrate status scripts for production
  migrations (migrate dev is dev-only, never used in production)
- Enable NestJS shutdown hooks and add safe (no-secrets) startup log
- Add .env.example for root, frontend, backend/api, backend/speech
  documenting exact variable names found in source
- Fix .gitignore so .env.example files aren't swallowed by the .env*
  exclusion, and add IDE temp file / speech venv patterns
